  (154, '16036', '종려방동사니', 'Cyperus alternifolius', 'Cyperus', 'Umbrella Plant', NULL, '사초과', '잎보기식물', '녹색, 연두색', 'NORMAL', '중간 광도(800~1,500 Lux),높은 광도(1,500~10,000 Lux)', 'MEDIUM', 'HIGH', '거실 창측 (실내깊이 150~300cm),발코니 내측 (실내깊이 50~150cm),발코니 창측 (실내깊이 0~50cm)', '16~20℃', 16, 20, 10, '40 ~ 70%', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Uses: Water gardens, bogs, water peripheries, tubs, containers Soil Type: A GOOD general purpose potting soil (a soil that retains water yet drains well) will suffice. Check purchased soil to see that it is well aerated and add sand or perlite and peat moss if it seems to pack too tightly. Give the plants a chance to settle in before going back to whatever fertilization program has been successful for you. If you want to mix your own take: 1 part garden soil, 1 part coarse sand or perlite, 1 part moist peat or humus (leaf mold) and a light dusting of lime. Always use a pot with a hole. Growth Rate: Fast Growing Ease: Will grow for anybody Flower Color: Beige', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
